  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving the black granite supply chain from the Netherlands to Zimbabwe</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reduce the CSR risk in the granite value chain in Zimbabwe</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of this project is to increase the transparency of the granite value chain in Zimbabwe.A consortium of Dutch natural stone companies and their major Italian supplier cooperate with the local Zimbabwean granite exporter to investigate the corporate social responsibility (CSR) risks in the relevant Zimbabwean granite quarries and come up with a plan of action to reduce these CSR risks.</narrative>
  </description>
